or=\"black\" width=\"84\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/unique/maidenpike.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"112\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:56/112\" width=\"56\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Lycander's \nFlank</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Ceremonial Pike</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"215\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(132.5-154) To (305-356)</font> (218.75-255 Avg)<br>Required \nLevel: 42<br>Required Strength: 115<br>Required Dexterity: 98<br>Durability: \n25<br>(Amazon Only)<br>Base Weapon Speed: [20]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-200% \nEnhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 25-50 \nDamage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Amazon Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% Increased Attack Speed</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">5-9% Life \nStolen Per Hit</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 To \nStrength</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20 To Vitality</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20% Enhanced Defense</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Javelin \nand Spear Skills (Amazon Only)</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"231\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>양손 \n                            데미지 : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(132.5